[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Vienna Game"]
[Variation "Vienna Game: Vienna Gambit, 3...Bc5"]
[ECO "C25"]
[Character "gambit,sharp"]
[Risk "low"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "none"]
[Themes "centre-fight"]
[Kind "rare"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. f4 Bc5? { Develops the bishop towards f2, but it does not stop fxe5. }
4. fxe5 { Takes the pawn, which kicks the knight. The knight cannot safely go anywhere active. } 4... Ng8 (4... Nxe4 5. Nxe4 { Takes the knight. If the bishop grabs the rook on g1, Rxg1 leaves White a piece up. } 5... Bxg1 6. Rxg1 d5 7. Ng3) (4... Nc6 5. exf6 Qxf6 6. Nf3)
5. d4 { Hits the bishop and builds the centre. The knight has been pushed back to g8. } 5... Bb6 (5... Bxd4 6. Qxd4 { Wins the bishop for a pawn, and the queen is well placed in the centre, attacking g7. })
6. Qg4 { Attacks g7, which Black cannot defend easily. Black must give up castling or lose a pawn, and White stays a pawn up. } 6... Kf8 *
